# context/graphify.pin — the graphify pin: one row, `graphify <version> <exclude-newer-date>`.
# Read by scripts/install-deps.sh (uv tool install graphifyy==<version> --exclude-newer <date>); context/code-index.lock's
# graphify row must carry the same version and date (scripts/code-index-lock.sh check, CODEIDX-LOCK-007).
# The version is an exact release at least 14 days old. The date is the next 00:00Z after the last upload of any of the release's
# files: uv excludes files uploaded at or after it, so an earlier date would exclude the pinned release itself.
graphify 0.9.67 2026-09-24T00:00:00Z
